== Architectures ==

[[Intel_AMD64|Intel64 / AMD64]] (also known as x86-64) is the first architecture {{project_name_short}} ever ran on, and it remains the '''best supported'''. Ready-to-use images are available from the [[Download]] page.

The remaining architectures are supported for '''testers only'''. At the time of writing there are no downloadable images ("ports") and no estimated time of arrival (ETA). Testers can attempt to build images from source code, and Distribution Morphing may also be possible.

* [[Intel_AMD64|Intel64 / AMD64]] - best supported; ready-to-use images on the [[Download]] page.
* [[ARM64]] - testers only; no downloadable images yet.
* [[Raspberry_Pi|Raspberry Pi (RPi)]] - testers only; might become available a while after the port to Debian 13 (trixie).
* [[PPC64]] - testers only; no downloadable images yet.
* [[RISCV64]] - testers only; no downloadable images yet.
* [[macOS|Apple Mac]] - Intel Macs run inside [[VirtualBox]]; [[macOS#Apple_Silicon|Apple Silicon]] (M1, M2, M3, M4) is not yet available (developers only).

